OL,3,GNEWSAB&Q and Five Guys among firms that
OL,4,Apaid staff below minimum wage
OL,5,
OL,6,FDIY store B&Q and the fast food chain
OL,7,FFive Guys are among hundreds of UK
OL,8,Fbusinesses named by the government for
OL,9,Fpaying staff below the minimum wage.
OL,11,FMore than 600 employers were ordered to
OL,12,Fpay affected workers the outstanding
OL,13,Fwages, with #4m returned to workers,
OL,14,Faccording to the Department for
OL,15,FBusiness and Trade.
OL,17,FThe firms have also been issued
OL,18,Fpenalties worth #7m.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
